m is **not basic connectivity anymore**. We have now proven:\n\n**Account ✅ → IAM identity ✅ → `us-east-2` ✅ → Bedrock key ✅ → Mantle endpoint ✅ → authentication ✅ → model discovery ✅**\n\nNow we go **one step further only**: verify that **Kimi K2.5 is actually in the returned model list**.\n\nRun this:\n\n```powershell\n(Invoke-RestMethod `\n  -Method Get `\n  -Uri \"$env:OPENAI_BASE_URL/models\" `\n  -Headers @{ Authorization = \"Bearer $env:OPENAI_API_KEY\" }\n).data |\nWhere-Object { $_.id -like \"*kimi*\" } |\nSelect-Object id, status, owned_by\n```\n\nPaste that output back.\n\nIf `moonshotai.kimi-k2.5` appears as `available`, then the next step is one tiny inference call and we will have fully proven the path."]}, "create_time": 1790215734.749412, "end_turn": true, "id": "993b48a6-88eb-4673-98c4-ce05a3066c47", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "3ugehh", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab41b7c2620819187c626358eeb8a48", "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "fe8f6f1a-cdee-4471-b6ae-d59dabce770e", "request_id": "73276842-6610-4516-b932-c39278683ed7", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "2ee5888e-d363-42f4-81be-bc0be1f8caad", "working_turn_id": "2ee5888e-d363-42f4-81be-bc0be1f8caad"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1790215745.635776, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "user"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["Yeah baby, yeah baby, we get my Kimi 2.5 back. It is available.  id                